\f0\fs24 \cf0 STI Estimator\
\
The STI estimator uses equations found in this research paper:\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs26 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Leccese, Francesco, Michele Rocca, and Giacomo Salvadori. "Fast estimation of Speech Transmission Index using the Reverberation Time: Comparison between predictive equations for educational rooms of different sizes." 
\f2\i Applied Acoustics
\f1\i0  140 (2018): 143-149.\
\
To estimate the STI of a small classroom/conference room.  The user will input the number of surfaces of the space, and then the surface areas of these spaces, along with the absorption coefficients for the respective surface areas. Given these parameters the user can then click \'91calculate\'92 and the application will calculate the total absorption of the room, the RT60 at 500 Hz, the STI and the Articulation of Consonants percentage.\
\
